WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:08.220
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:14.730
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.560
It's my day!

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:27.140
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:34.550
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:41.920
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:49.330
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:55.100
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:02.240
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:09.750
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:15.890
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:18.950
I just want to walk

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:22.490
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:26.460
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:35.370
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:41.810
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.080
It's my day!

00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:52.090
<i>Quit acting like kids!</i>

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:07.440
<i>Rui Hanazawa saved me...</i>

00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:10.440
<i>I can't believe it!</i>

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:18.750
"Me, Him, and the Other Guy!"

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:23.820
Cut the crap, Rui.

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:27.420
You realize what 
you're doing, right?

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:30.790
Tsukasa...

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:33.460
Back off, okay?

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:39.830
Rui... don't tell me...

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:42.800
you <i>like</i> this little hick?

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:06.830
Well?!

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:14.740
<i>No way!</i>

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:16.700
<i>He's not denying it!</i>

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:25.510
I hope you know what this means.

00:03:27.110 --> 00:03:28.880
You'll be the school reject!

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:31.420
And you can forget about
being in the F4!

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:35.690
Drop her already!

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:37.660
Ow!

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:40.320
Tsukasa. You're hurting her.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:41.800
Ow!

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:44.800
Shut up! Like I give a crap
about her!

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:46.660
You let go!

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:48.370
Ow!!!

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:49.830
It hurts!

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:54.610
You're hurting me!

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:57.370
Let go, you moron!

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:05.580
Listen, Rui!

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:07.980
Our friendship is over.

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:10.400
I won't even speak
 to you anymore!

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:16.760
Let's get outta here.

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:17.860
Akira! Sojiro!

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:19.660
"Get outta here"?

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:22.870
Hey! Hold on!

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:24.170
No way!

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:25.470
The F4 is finished!

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:27.070
No way!

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:30.170
<i>It can't be...</i>

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:37.210
<i>It can't...</i>

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:54.460
<i>Shizuka Todo?</i>

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:57.930
Let's go to the ladies' room.

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:00.600
We have to clean you up.

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:03.400
Come on. On your feet.

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:10.390
They're not such bad people,
you know.

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:13.680
But sometimes they get
carried away.

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:19.290
<i>Look at those long eyelashes!</i>

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:21.820
<i>No way are we
in the same species!</i>

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:25.630
<i>Skin like porcelain... and she just...</i>

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:27.030
...smells so good!

00:05:27.730 --> 00:05:28.260
Huh?

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:33.070
Oh! Pay thee no mind!

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:36.900
I mean... that is... pay me no mind.

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:40.040
<i>Aw jeez... I'm such a 
basket case with her!</i>

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:43.380
You're a pretty interesting person.

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:47.110
Here. Use this to wipe your face.

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:49.350
Thank you!

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:57.890
I've never seen Rui show such passion
in front of others before.

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:01.190
I wonder if he likes you.

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:02.860
Huh?

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:05.670
No way. That's impossible!

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:09.140
Next to you, I'm a total dishrag.

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:10.970
I'm nowhere near your league.

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:13.670
Besides, Hanazawa is in love with you!

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:15.440
Maybe so.

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:21.410
But I can't help but feel...

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:30.720
that one day he'll leave me.

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:34.310
<i>Shizuka! I don't want
 you to go to France!</i>

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:36.930
<i>I want you to stay here with me!</i>

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:38.930
<i>Shizuka!</i>

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:53.010
Oops. You've still got some dirt
on your face.

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:03.590
A girl's always got to look
her best.

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:08.130
You never know when Mr. Right
will come along.

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:14.000
Those are great shoes.

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:22.170
In Europe, they always say
to wear good shoes.

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:24.570
"When you wear beautiful shoes...

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:27.810
...they will take you to
beautiful places."

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:42.160
There!

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:46.080
<i>She's so wonderful...</i>

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:49.100
<i>She takes my breath away.</i>

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:56.940
<i>We might come from
different worids...</i>

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:00.540
<i>But she's a nice person.</i>

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:14.890
<i>She's nothing like Asai...</i>

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:18.330
<i>...and her snotty clique.</i>

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:31.440
<i>Rui Hanazawa!</i>

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:47.820
You know earlier?

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:53.090
<i>I wonder if he likes you.</i>

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:55.800
<i>No way!</i>

00:08:58.130 --> 00:08:58.730
Yes?

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:03.670
Thanks for what you did.

00:09:04.470 --> 00:09:05.110
Right...

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:10.780
But if it wasn't for me, you and Domyoji
would still be friends.

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:13.910
It wasn't your fault.

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:16.320
I was just a bit on edge.

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:21.850
Why?!

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:35.770
<i>Why did you save me?</i>

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:39.770
Ah... i-it's nothing...

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:46.710
<i>Why did you give up everything
to help me?</i>

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:51.980
<i>I can still feel his arms
around my shoulders...</i>

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:54.190
<i>...around me.</i>

00:09:57.420 --> 00:09:59.590
<i>Quit acting like kids!</i>

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:06.080
<i>You held me so easily with
those slim arms...</i>

00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:12.640
<i>You really are the man 
I thought you were.</i>

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:19.030
Tsukushi!

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:23.010
There you are!

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:25.380
Kazuya!

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:29.190
What's on your head?

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:33.020
A soldier's gotta armor up
for battle.

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:37.620
Now they can throw anything at me!
I'm ready for 'em!

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:43.030
But talk about thrills and spills!

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:46.540
I've never been chased by
so many people before.

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:48.000
It was right out of a movie!

00:10:48.070 --> 00:10:49.270
What a rush!

00:10:50.970 --> 00:10:54.140
<i>He's got more guts than
I gave him credit for!</i>

00:10:55.910 --> 00:10:56.380
Huh?

00:10:57.710 --> 00:10:59.050
Say, Tsukushi...

00:10:59.980 --> 00:11:01.050
<i>Huh? What?</i>

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:04.290
Would you like to go to Atami 
with me this summer?

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:07.260
My family's got a villa there.

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:11.530
A villa... in Atami?

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:13.500
Cool!

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:16.970
I know it! Being <i>nouveau riche</i>
has its perks!

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:20.770
Huh? You look flushed, Tsukushi.

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:25.770
I... I... feel faint.

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:32.550
Hey!

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:34.820
Tsukushi!

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:37.250
Are you all right?

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:39.650
Stay with me!

00:11:41.390 --> 00:11:42.660
Tsukushi!

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:48.630
<i>No... I can't go on anymore.</i>

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:52.570
Tsukushi!

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.490
38.6 degrees.

00:12:20.230 --> 00:12:21.160
I feel awful...

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:24.730
Weird. You hardly ever 
get a fever like that.

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:28.430
Well, I have to get to work.
But stay in bed while I'm gone.

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:29.000
Okay.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:33.070
I've gotta go, too.

00:12:36.310 --> 00:12:37.710
<i>So much has been going on...</i>

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:40.610
<i>I guess I just got 
overwhelmed by it all.</i>

00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:45.990
<i>I hope Kazuya's doing all right
without me.</i>

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:52.460
Hold up!

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:54.760
I'll call the cops on you!

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:59.330
Huh? Makino's out sick?

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:03.300
Damn... that girl's just
running scared.

00:13:05.770 --> 00:13:07.140
She gave us the rip!

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:09.540
You mean "gave us the slip"!

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:18.680
A cold, huh?

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:22.350
I guess even a woman like her
has weaknesses.

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:56.420
Come to make up?

00:13:57.820 --> 00:13:58.520
Hell no!

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:01.860
We're not friends anymore.

00:14:02.390 --> 00:14:04.230
I don't even wanna talk to you.

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:07.600
But you are.

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:08.830
W-what?!

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:26.850
<i>There's no way...</i>

00:14:27.180 --> 00:14:28.750
<i>...he's serious about Makino.</i>

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:31.150
Huh?!

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:32.520
Oww!

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:34.790
What's your problem?

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:39.660
All right!

00:14:45.770 --> 00:14:47.230
Feeling any better?

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:49.570
I'm still a little feverish.

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:50.670
But I'm feeling all right.

00:14:51.510 --> 00:14:53.470
Can't keep a good girl down!

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:56.610
Mom wants to know if
you're up for some dinner.

00:14:57.310 --> 00:14:58.180
Sure!

00:14:58.210 --> 00:14:59.280
W-who are you?!

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:02.450
Tsukushi's in bed with a fever.

00:15:05.990 --> 00:15:07.450
W-what's going on?!

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:11.160
What do you want
with my daughter?

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:12.390
What is it?

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:14.930
There's a strange boy at
the door asking for you...

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:16.090
Huh?!

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:20.370
Yo!

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:22.500
Hey...

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.340
What're you doing here?

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:29.410
Right! You've worn out
your welcome, here!

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:32.280
You and your wormy hairdo!

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:38.250
Mom. Dad. This guy's the one
who made me sick!

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:39.890
Tsukasa Domyoji!

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:43.560
Mom? Dad?

00:15:45.390 --> 00:15:46.630
Domyoji?

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:50.930
Domyoji... as in the Domyoji Group?

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:54.270
Yes. How do you do?

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:59.640
Oh... how embarrassing to have you
visit our shabby little home.

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:01.340
But do come in!

00:16:01.410 --> 00:16:03.140
We'll get you some slippers!

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:06.810
You know, I think your hairstyle
is very regal.

00:16:07.180 --> 00:16:09.620
Won't you join us for dinner?

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:12.950
Although it's nothing much
by your standards.

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:19.920
<i>I'm cursed with psychotic parents!</i>

00:16:21.190 --> 00:16:24.230
Hmm... I can't believe people can live
under these conditions.

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:27.400
It's the size of my bathroom.

00:16:28.030 --> 00:16:29.600
So why are you here?

00:16:30.770 --> 00:16:32.840
Heard you came home sick.

00:16:32.870 --> 00:16:35.440
So I came to see your
pasty face for myself.

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:38.810
What kind of moron catches
cold in the summer?

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:41.380
<i>W-why you...!</i>

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:45.920
Takes one to know one!

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:49.490
Are you asking for another beating?

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:55.860
Mercy, what a rude child!

00:16:55.890 --> 00:16:57.560
My sincerest apologies!

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.000
Oh...

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:00.700
This way...

00:17:00.730 --> 00:17:02.470
Dinner is ready!

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:03.930
Right through here!

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:07.740
<i>Mom!</i>

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:10.340
I'm so sorry it's so humble...

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:12.910
I don't know if it'll agree
with you.

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:15.110
What's this?

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.550
Stewed taro.

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:19.950
It's embarrassingly simple.

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:25.020
I suppose your mother wouldn't
cook something so plain.

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:31.990
No... my mother doesn't cook
at all, honestly.

00:17:32.060 --> 00:17:33.230
We have a chef at our house.

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:35.200
"Chef"?!

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:39.670
Please help yourself.

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:42.240
Thank you, I will.

00:17:51.010 --> 00:17:52.380
<i>I keep forgetting...</i>

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:56.450
<i>He was born with a silver spoon
in his mouth.</i>

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:01.160
<i>No wonder he's got such
good manners.</i>

00:18:02.590 --> 00:18:05.590
<i>The way he eats is so refined.</i>

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:11.400
<i>Argh! Don't get suckered by
this smooth operator!</i>

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:20.370
Thank you very much
for a wonderful meal.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:22.310
You're very welcome!

00:18:22.680 --> 00:18:24.650
I'm sorry we didn't have
more to offer.

00:18:25.420 --> 00:18:26.480
Hey, Tsukushi.

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:28.150
See him halfway home!

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:34.490
Huh? Why me? I'm the
 recuperating patient, here!

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:38.290
If all goes well,
we'll be set for life!

00:18:38.390 --> 00:18:39.730
Go get 'im, Tsukushi!

00:18:42.530 --> 00:18:44.660
We'll let you have one
goodnight kiss!

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:49.640
<i>What are my parents saying?!</i>

00:18:56.020 --> 00:18:59.550
You're just like your mom.

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:00.850
I am not!

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:04.980
What's with you
and your smarmy act?

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.590
Did you really enjoy dinner?

00:19:08.990 --> 00:19:11.520
All lower-class fare tastes terrible.

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:14.360
Hmph!

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:23.740
So... what're you doing for summer?

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:25.740
Going to Hawaii?

00:19:26.840 --> 00:19:28.340
You've seen our lifestyle.

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:30.640
We can't afford luxuries like that.

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:34.410
This is why I hate the working class.

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:37.020
Can't even afford a lousy
500,000 yen?

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:46.860
If you insist... I can pay your way.

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:50.670
No thanks! I'm already
going to Atami.

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:52.660
Atami?

00:19:53.860 --> 00:19:56.400
Kazuya invited me to his villa!

00:19:57.970 --> 00:20:00.040
Mr. <i>Nouveau Riche</i> has a villa?

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:03.070
Yeah. And I can't wait!

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:07.310
Besides, who'd want to put up
with your mug in the summer, too?

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:09.550
Later!

00:20:16.890 --> 00:20:17.550
I'm back!

00:20:18.390 --> 00:20:20.360
How'd it go, Tsukushi?

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:22.790
Nothing happened.

00:20:25.730 --> 00:20:28.970
Hey Sis. 
Your friend dropped this off.

00:20:30.670 --> 00:20:32.400
Said you left it on
the locker room floor.

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:43.110
<i>Tsukushi...</i>

00:20:45.350 --> 00:20:47.050
<i>How are you feeling?</i>

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:49.590
<i>Get well soon!</i>

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:56.730
<i>Get well soon!</i>

00:20:58.260 --> 00:21:00.430
Thanks, Makiko.

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:02.630
I'm much better now.

00:21:18.550 --> 00:21:19.480
Good morning!

00:21:20.480 --> 00:21:21.660
Tsukushi!

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:23.650
Feeling better?

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:26.650
Uh-huh. Sorry to scare you like that.

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:39.100
Hey. We're not doing
Hawaii this year.

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:41.200
The islands are totally out of style.

00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:41.870
Huh?

00:21:42.470 --> 00:21:44.050
Why the sudden change of plans?

00:21:47.270 --> 00:21:49.740
From now on, Atami's where it's at.

00:21:51.180 --> 00:21:52.150
We're going to Atami!

00:22:05.330 --> 00:22:11.400
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.370 --> 00:22:19.270
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.040 --> 00:22:29.150
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.380 --> 00:22:37.190
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.190 --> 00:22:44.960
Until after we've split
